  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperative Mitiiri Rice Production and Marketing project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice.Beneficiaries: 152 34 women).Description: The group seeks to increase yields through improved access to inputs access and improved techniques, expand the area under production from 130 ha to 399 ha with use of a new tractor, and increase revenues by obtaining higher prices for their produce through storage and grouped sales.</narrative>
